      "statement": "Gadi Eisenkot was appointed to form a government after a parliamentary election deadlock in Israel.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The opposition bloc secured 48 seats, while Netanyahu’s Likud party won 53 seats, leaving a path to form a government unclear.",
